msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/autostart-troubleshooting.rst:17
#: 76711008ca9a422585c50a8c681b5929
msgid ""
"Press the ``E`` key on the first prompt (or your custom prompt). Then, press "
"the down arrow key multiple times to reach the line starting with ``module2 /"
"vmlinuz``."
msgstr ""

